                          "text":  "I could. In 1986 I reached Uranus, a pale blue-green world tipped on its side. In 1989 I reached Neptune, deep blue, with a dark storm as wide as Earth, and a frozen moon with geysers. No spacecraft had been to either planet before me. None has been since. Almost everything in your books about those two worlds up close came from my few hours there.",
